tive direction: signed -0.429, interval -0.611 to -0.247. I reject the registered H116 formulation, close it, and register a reversed interaction refinement to test the opposite hypothesis. I also registered direct high/low feature_063 strata for feature_038, feature_018, and feature_036 to interpret accepted or reversed interactions. These conclusions remain descriptive associations within this supplied dataset only; multiplicity and multiple comparisons remain concerns, and no causal or generalizable interpretation is made.",
