dification persists when the major binary predictors are not present, reducing the possibility that the accepted interactions are artifacts of confounding by those large-effect labels. The expected directions are unchanged: more negative feature_063 effects when feature_038 is high, and less negative feature_063 effects when feature_018 is high. All hypotheses are descriptive associations in this dataset only, not causal effects or generalizable claims.",
