  "narrative": "No assessments are due. I propose focused follow-up of the accepted feature_063 association because it is the most decision-relevant remaining scientific question after validation of the clean feature_038 and feature_018 geometry. The registered comparisons test whether the clean feature_063 lower-outcome association survives within feature_036-defined subsets of the feature_038 strata, whether it remains concentrated when one of the large binary labels is present, and whether clinical variables log_pfs or age explain the association after removing feature_010, feature_002, and feature_037. Direct feature_063 present-minus-absent contrasts are registered with direction -1 because the accepted pattern is feature_063 presence associated with lower outcome_001, i.e. raw negative composite-score differences that are reported as positive signed estimates. The clean feature_038-high contrasts are expected to remain threshold-supported; feature_036-high attenuation is plausible because the original clean feature_036-high direct contrast was smaller than the feature_036-low contrast, but a null feature_036 effect is also plausible because the clean feature_036 interaction was null. The clean feature_038-low splits are expected to be near null, so any threshold-supported result would indicate residual structure not captured by feature_038 alone. The feature_010-positive and feature_037-positive high-feature_038 contrasts test generalization beyond the clean all-label-absent population; high-feature_038 is expected to show the lower-outcome association if the signature concentration is not an artifact of clean-stratum selection, while low-feature_038 is expected to be null or subthreshold. Clean high-log_pfs is expected to support the feature_063 association, consistent with the non-clean high-log_pfs contrast, while low-log_pfs is uncertain because its non-clean estimate was near threshold but interval-crossing. Clean age-under-60 is expected to be supported, whereas age-60-and-over is expected to be attenuated or uncertain because the non-clean age-high contrast was below threshold. These are descriptive dataset comparisons, not causal effects or external generalizations; acceptance will require signed estimates and uncertainty that support a difference beyond the 0.15 composite dependency-score-unit threshold in the registered direction.",
  "research_notes": "Current model: feature_010 and feature_002 presence are associated with much higher outcome_001; feature_037 presence is associated with much lower outcome_001. feature_063 presence is associated with lower outcome_001 overall, with robust validation in the clean all-label-absent stratum and the clean feature_038-high feature_018-low stratum. Accepted clean conditional interactions support concentration when feature_038 is high and attenuation when feature_018 is high; feature_036 has not supported meaningful modification. Binary research markers feature_007, feature_058, and feature_015 remain negative overall and in simple interactions. Validation nuances: H119, H137, and H115 have validation direction support but threshold-level magnitude is less secure. Active accepted clean interactions H140, H144, H145, H146 remain discovery-supported and are candidates for later validation. New plan: split the clean feature_038-high direct feature_063 contrast by feature_036-high and feature_036-low to test residual third-assay modification; split clean feature_038-low by feature_036 to see whether accepted feature_036-low overall effect is confined to feature_038-high. Test feature_063 by feature_038 in feature_010-positive and feature_037-positive strata to see whether the signature concentration persists when a large label is present. Test clean feature_063 effects by median log_pfs and age cutoffs to determine whether clinical variables explain or further modify the association. Interpretation rule: if high-feature_038 cells remain threshold-supported while low-feature_038 cells remain null, the concentration is robust; if high-feature_036 cells attenuate or nullify, feature_036 may have residual modification; if label-positive high-feature_038 cells support the effect, the association is not an artifact only of the clean all-label-absent stratum; if clean age or log_pfs splits mirror prior results, those variables do not explain the feature_063 effect. All conclusions remain limited to associations in the supplied dataset."
