  "narrative": "The newly delivered validations require a narrower interpretation. H137 clean feature_038-high/feature_018-high direct feature_063 contrast was discovery-supported at +0.303 with 95% interval +0.155 to +0.452, but independent validation gave +0.202 with adjusted interval -0.112 to +0.515. The validation point remains same-signed, but the interval crosses both null and the 0.15-unit threshold, and the exposed cell is only n=26. I therefore reassess H137 as unresolved and keep it active for label-robust follow-up because the high-high magnitude is directionally suggestive but not independently secure. H145 clean reciprocal feature_038-by-feature_063 interaction inside feature_018-high was discovery-supported at +0.808 with interval +0.656 to +0.960, but validation gave +0.320 with adjusted interval -0.094 to +0.733. This supports the same direction pointwise but is imprecise and not threshold-validated, so I reassess H145 as unresolved and keep it active for follow-up. The validated central pattern remains: feature_063 presence is associated with lower outcome_001 overall and in clean label-absent cells; within feature_038-high cells the association is strongest when feature_018 is low, and feature_018-high attenuates it; within feature_038-low cells the association is null. The collinear label cluster feature_010, feature_002, and feature_037 remains very strongly associated with outcome_001 in both feature_038 strata, but cannot be decomposed. Negative findings remain: research markers feature_007, feature_058, and feature_015 show no meaningful overall association or simple interactions; feature_036 does not meaningfully modify feature_063; age and log_pfs interactions inside feature_038-high are not supported, although direct feature_063 contrasts across those splits remain threshold-supported. Most informative next step is label-robust feature_037-absent high-high direct and reciprocal interaction refinements of H137 and H145, which increase cells while controlling the strongest inverse label and can distinguish small-sample instability from genuine attenuation. All claims remain supplied-dataset associations, not causal or generalizable mechanisms.",
  "research_notes": "Updated final central pattern. Validated core: feature_063 presence associated with lower outcome_001 overall H49, clean label-absent H93, feature_038-high direct H132, feature_038-high/feature_018-low direct H136, and feature_018-high attenuation inside feature_038-high H146. feature_038-low direct is null. Label cluster feature_010 and feature_002 show very large positive associations with outcome_001 and feature_037 shows large reverse association, persisting across feature_038 strata, but collinearity prevents decomposition. Negative: research markers feature_007, feature_058, feature_015 overall and simple interactions; feature_036 modification of feature_063; age and log_pfs interactions within feature_038-high. Unresolved after new validations: H137 clean high-high direct effect and H145 reciprocal feature_038 interaction within feature_018-high downgraded to unresolved because independent adjusted intervals are imprecise and below threshold despite same-signed discovery. Other unresolved or suggestive items include H141/H143 interactions, label-positive small-exposed subgroups H153/H155, H158/H159, and invalid exact continuous comparisons with insufficient cells. Next: registered label-robust feature_037-absent direct high-high and reciprocal interaction refinements, plus possible nonclean analog robustness. All conclusions remain descriptive associations in the supplied dataset only."
