  "narrative": "No assessments are due. I register label-robust and assay-gradient refinements to the central feature_063 findings. For all feature_063 present-minus-absent claims, direction is -1 because the raw exposed-minus-comparator association is expected to be negative; signed positive evidence therefore supports feature_063 presence being associated with lower outcome_001. The first block tests whether the strongest validated geometry, feature_038-high with feature_018-low, remains threshold-supported when the clean-label requirement is relaxed to control the strongly inverse label feature_037 but allow feature_010 and feature_002. This includes the direct contrast and the reciprocal feature_038 interaction within feature_018-low. The feature_038-high and feature_038-low analogs under feature_037 absence test whether the high-versus-low concentration survives that partial deconfounding, with feature_038-low expected to remain null. The next block uses partial controls, especially feature_010 absent and feature_002 absent, to address the unresolved feature_038-high/feature_018-high cell and small exposed cells in some accepted label-positive subgroups. The assay-gradient block tests whether the feature_063 contrast strengthens when feature_038 is more strongly high and feature_018 is not high, and whether feature_018-high attenuation persists at more extreme feature_038 thresholds. The age-conditional feature_037-absent direct contrast probes whether the accepted feature_038-high age split is confounded by the label cluster. These are still descriptive comparisons in the supplied dataset and not causal or generalizable claims. If any cell falls below the minimum size, the comparison should be treated as a specification failure rather than evidence.",
  "research_notes": "Updated final central pattern remains: feature_063 presence is associated with lower outcome_001, strongest when feature_038 is high and feature_018 is low, attenuated when feature_018 is high, and absent when feature_038 is low; clean label-absent direct high/low and validated reciprocal interaction remain central. H137 and H145 remain unresolved after validation because independent intervals are imprecise and below threshold despite same-signed discovery. The collinear labels feature_010, feature_002, and feature_037 have large associations with outcome_001 that persist across feature_038 strata, so label-robust testing is needed. New registered proposals test: (1) feature_037-absent feature_063 contrasts in feature_038-high/feature_018-low and reciprocal feature_038 interaction, (2) partial controls by feature_010 or feature_002 absence, especially for high-high cells, (3) feature_038-high and low direct contrasts under feature_037 absence to test whether the high-low concentration survives, (4) extreme standardized assay thresholds to test monotonic gradient and attenuation, and (5) feature_037-absent age split within feature_038-high. All feature_063 present-minus-absent claims use direction -1; positive signed estimates indicate raw lower outcome_001. feature_018 attenuation interactions use direction +1. Interpret only as supplied-dataset associations, not causal mechanisms or generalizable biology. If a proposal yields insufficient cells, treat it as invalid rather than null."
